### PATCH update a body
PATCH http://localhost:3000/bodies/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "description": "the smallest planet, the closest planet to the sun and the fastest planet its orbit"
}

### DELETE a body

DELETE http://localhost:3000/bodies/3
# TODO: Send a DELETE request for body 3.

### get earth with name
GET http://localhost:3000/bodies?name:eq=earth
Accept : application/json

### GET earth's img

GET http://localhost:3000/earth.jpg
Accept: application/json